  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral Area-based Response for Life Saving and Dignity Restoration to Crisis-affected Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project goal is to restored dignity, protection, and better resilience for idps, vulnerable individuals, and populations affected by ongoing and acute crises. The total number of beneficiaries that will be supported under this award is 67,928 individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
